B.bZW=new A.fI(B.GU,"10-Second Express Counter Billing & Atomic Seat Parity","Lightning-fast cash payment recording with instant digital receipts and zero-drift concurrency safety ensuring double-seat allocations are completely prevented.","Billing & Parity","point_of_sale","/admin/home","Collect Fee")
B.bZX=new A.fI(B.jG,"Silent Reception & Noise Help Button","Study in complete peace. Discreetly alert reception about noise, AC temperature, Wi-Fi issues, or desk hygiene without leaving your seat or causing a disturbance.","Quiet Study","volume_off","/student/feedback","Explore Help Desk")
